### OAuth2 Implicit

The implicit flow obtains the access token out of band (typically in the browser). Pass the token to the authenticator:

```typescript statements
import { OAuth2ImplicitAuthenticator, {{clientClassName}} } from '{{npmName}}';

const authenticator = new OAuth2ImplicitAuthenticator(
  'https://api.example.com',
  'client-id',
  'https://auth.example.com/authorize',
  ['read'],
);
authenticator.setAccessToken('your-access-token');
const client = new {{clientClassName}}(authenticator);
```

{{/hasOAuth2Implicit}}
